# Weekly review rules

When asked for a weekly review:

1. Report counts by funnel stage and role cluster.
2. Identify stale records and overdue next actions.
3. Compare response rates by resume version and source only when sample size is shown.
4. Separate observations from hypotheses.
5. Recommend no more than three changes for the next week.
6. Do not recommend changing strategy from tiny samples without saying so.
7. End with a concrete seven-day operating plan.
